    "body": "I dug into this a bit. We looked into an ASCII fast path in the past. They are bad: https://github.com/whatwg/url/pull/309#issuecomment-301405332 (and also #267). `xn--` prefixed host names have to conform to the rules of UTS46. If they don't, they'll be considered in error.",
